        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "IdentifyIntent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774259305928"
          },
          "code": "IDENTIFYINTENT",
          "id": "1765818319888",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765818319891_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Instructions:{instructions}**\nClassify user input  {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}  into one intent: Reserve  or Active or Outbound or Lock or Unknown or Cancel OBLPN or Hold Task\n a. Reserve: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"List the Inbound LPNs that has expired\" or \"What containers are about to expire\" or \"List the LPNs that has expired\" or \"List the containers with expired inventory in Area R01 and Aisle 2\" or something similar related to expired inventory in Reserve\n b. Active: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"List the active locations with expired inventory\" or \"What locations in active have inventory that are about to expire\" or \"List the locations with expired inventory\" or something similar related to expired inventory in locations or Active locations.\n c. Outbound: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"List the OBLPNs that has expired\" or \"What outbound containers are about to expire\" or something similar related to expired inventory that are outbound.\n a1. ReserveAllocatedTask: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"List the tasks with expired IBLPNs\" or \"What allocated containers with tasks have expired\" or \"List the expired LPNs with tasks\" or \"List the allocated IBLPNs that has expired\" or something similar related to expired inventory in Reserve\n b1. ActiveAllocatedTask: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"List the tasks with expired active inventory\" or \"What allocated inventory with tasks have expired\" or \"List the expired inventory with tasks\" or \"List the allocated inventory that has expired\" or something similar related to expired inventory in Active\n d. Lock: Classify the intent as following if input contains like \"Lock the container CSPMM0001 with lock code UNALLOC\" or something similar\n e. Unknown: Classify the intent as following if input contains like \"Hi\" or something similar or anything that does not clearly mention Reserve, Active, Outbound or Lock\n f. Cancel OBLPN: Classify the intent as following if input is \"Cancel containers OBLPN1, OBLPN2, OBLPN3\" or \"Cancel OBLPN1, OBLPN2, OBLPN3\" or \"Cancel OBLPNs OBLPN1, OBLPN2, OBLPN3\" or . (Note the keyword OBLPN can be used synonymously for container.)\ng. Hold Task: Classify the intent as following if input is \"Hold the tasks:TASK1, TASK2, TASK3\" or \"Put the following tasks in held status - TASK1, TASK2, TASK3\" or \"Move the tasks to held: TASK1, TASK2, TASK3\" or something similar."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Intent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "IsShowExpired"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "Reserve": "1766091473009",
            "Active": "1766089772721",
            "Outbound": "1766091341628",
            "Lock": "1766091805961",
            "Unknown": "1765819674814",
            "Cancel OBLPN": "1773854315138",
            "Hold Task": "1774298818011",
            "ReserveAllocatedTask": "1774919088542",
            "ActiveAllocatedTask": "1774919441889"
          },
          "code": "ISSHOWEXPIRED",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1765818391517",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765818391520_1",
              "name": "caseExpression",
