          "code": "DERIVECONTAINER",
          "id": "1765818983456",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765818983458_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Instructions:\n1. Extract `container_nbr` and `lock_codes` from `{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`.\n   - If the message says \"Lock container <container> using lock code <lock_code>\",\n     then set:\n     - `container_nbr` = <container>\n     - `lock_codes` = <lock_code>\n\n2. Find `ContainerID` for the derived `container_nbr` by matching it exactly against:\n   - `{{$context.$nodes.GETRESERVEEXPIREDCONTAINERSLOCK.$output}}`\n   - `{{$context.$nodes.GETRESERVEEXPIREDPALLETCONTAINERSLOCK.$output}}`\n   - `{{$context.$nodes.GETOBEXPIREDINVENTORYLOCK.$output}}`\n\n3. If no exact match is found, set `ContainerID` to null.\n\n4. Return ONLY valid JSON with exactly these keys:\n   - `container_nbr`\n   - `lock_codes`\n   - `ContainerID`\n\n5. Do not return any explanation, markdown, or extra text."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{ \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\", \"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": { \"container_nbr\": { \"type\": \"string\" }, \"lock_codes\": { \"type\": \"string\" }, \"ContainerID\": { \"type\": \"integer\" } } }",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
