          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SHOWLOCKSUCCESS",
          "id": "1765819570156",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765819570162_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Instructions:{instructions}**\nDerive container_nbr from input  \"{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\"  message. \"Lock container <container> using lock code <lock_code>\" then container_nbr = \"container\"\nStrictly display only the below output to user. Do not provide any followup questions or options and TERMINATE here.\n<strong>Container</strong> {container_nbr} <strong>is successfully locked with Lock: </strong> {{$context.$nodes.LOCKCONTAINER.$input.lock_codes}} \n<strong>Do you want to lock another container?</strong>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "HowToMessage"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "HOWTOMESSAGE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1765819674814",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765819674816_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "<div>\n  <p><strong>Hi — how can I help today?</strong></p>\n\n  <p><strong>Inventory and LPN actions:</strong></p>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      Listing expired Inbound or Outbound LPNs, sorted by earliest expiry first\n      <br />\n      <em>Example:</em> List expired Inbound LPNs\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      Listing active locations with expired inventory, sorted by earliest expiry first\n      <br />\n      <em>Example:</em> List active locations with expired inventory\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      Listing allocated expired Inbound LPNs or expired active inventory with tasks\n      <br />\n      <em>Example:</em> List allocated expired Inbound LPNs\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      Locking LPNs\n      <br />\n      <em>Example:</em> Lock LPN {lpn} using lock code {lock_code}\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      Canceling LPNs\n      <br />\n      <em>Example:</em> Cancel LPN {lpn} with reason code {reason_code}\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      Holding tasks\n      <br />\n      <em>Example:</em> Hold task {task_nbr}\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n\n\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n    Would you like me to list expired inventory, or perform an action like Lock, Hold, or Cancel?\n    Please send your request using one of the examples above.\n  </p>\n</div>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
